<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The launch screen, in the app's own motion language: a Material circle springs
  and turns into the Material 3 Expressive Cookie9Sided shape, and Jade pops onto
  it and blinks hello.

  The two shape paths are MaterialShapes.Circle and MaterialShapes.Cookie9Sided,
  taken from Morph(Circle, Cookie9Sided).asCubics(0f / 1f) (graphics-shapes), so
  they share one cubic structure and the platform can morph them. Viewport is the
  splash icon's 288-unit box; everything sits inside its 192-unit safe circle.
-->
